# Loon remote rules: Japan-JP
# GitHub source: Gavin-L/loon-config
# Two-column syntax: policy is assigned in [Remote Rule] of your private local config.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,reddit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redd.it
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,redditmedia.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tradingview.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tradingview-widget.com
